<amll:meta key="artists" value="王力宏"/>
<amll:meta key="album" value="改变自己"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1691044822"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:06.320"><div begin="14.667" end="41.073" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.667" end="21.049" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.667" end="15.779">已经听</span><span begin="15.779" end="16.403">了</span><span begin="16.403" end="17.640">一百遍</span> <span begin="18.001" end="19.189">怎么听</span><span begin="19.189" end="19.851">都</span><span begin="19.851" end="21.049">不会倦</span></p><p begin="21.520" end="27.338" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.520" end="22.597">从白天</span><span begin="22.597" end="23.222">唱</span><span begin="23.222" end="24.488">到黑夜</span> <span begin="24.681" end="25.896">你一直在</span><span begin="25.896" end="27.338">身边</span></p><p begin="26.912" end="28.907" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="26.912" end="27.484">一直在</span><span begin="27.484" end="28.907">身边</span></p><p begin="28.380" end="34.863" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.380" end="29.393">如果世</span><span begin="29.393" end="30.038">界</span><span begin="30.038" end="31.380">太危险</span> <span begin="31.709" end="32.808">只有音</span><span begin="32.808" end="33.502">乐</span><span begin="33.502" end="34.863">最安全</span></p><p begin="35.264" end="41.073" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.264" end="36.304">带着我</span><span begin="36.304" end="36.929">进</span><span begin="36.929" end="38.201">梦里面</span> <span begin="38.411" end="39.581">让歌词都</span><span begin="39.581" end="41.073">实现</span></p></div><div begin="41.493" end="1:08.534" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="41.493" end="45.457" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.493" end="44.457">无论是开心还是难过 我的爱一直</span><span begin="44.457" end="45.457">不变</span></p><p begin="45.467" end="48.359" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="45.467" end="45.762">不</span><span begin="45.762" end="47.196">必担心时间流逝</span> <span begin="47.196" end="48.359">带走一切</span></p><p begin="48.369" end="52.309" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.369" end="51.350">无论是Hip-Hop还是摇滚 我的爱一直</span><span begin="51.350" end="52.309">不变</span></p><p begin="52.102" end="55.379" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="52.102" end="52.549">所</span><span begin="52.549" end="53.267">有美好</span><span begin="53.267" end="53.915">回忆</span><span begin="53.915" end="55.379">记录在里面</span></p><p begin="55.219" end="59.160" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.219" end="56.633">这种forever love</span><span begin="56.633" end="57.502">那么深</span> <span begin="57.502" end="58.301">我们的歌</span><span begin="58.334" end="59.160">那么真</span></p><p begin="59.280" end="1:02.552" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.280" end="1:00.906">无国界 跨时代</span> <span begin="1:00.906" end="1:02.552">再也不会叫我kiss goodbye</span></p><p begin="1:02.562" end="1:08.534" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.562" end="1:03.299">要每一</span><span begin="1:03.299" end="1:03.956">句</span><span begin="1:03.956" end="1:04.212">能</span><span begin="1:04.212" end="1:04.834">够</span><span begin="1:04.834" end="1:05.357">动人</span><span begin="1:05.357" end="1:07.173">心弦</span> <span begin="1:07.173" end="1:08.534">Yeah</span></p></div><div begin="1:09.550" end="1:34.743" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:09.550" end="1:16.042" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.550" end="1:10.574">情人总</span><span begin="1:10.574" end="1:11.211">分</span><span begin="1:11.211" end="1:12.419">分合合</span> <span begin="1:12.419" end="1:14.046">可是我们却</span><span begin="1:14.046" end="1:14.652">越</span><span begin="1:14.652" end="1:15.241">爱越</span><span begin="1:15.241" end="1:16.042">深</span></p><p begin="1:16.414" end="1:23.051" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.414" end="1:17.766">认识你</span> <span begin="1:17.834" end="1:19.789">让我的幸福</span><span begin="1:19.789" end="1:23.051">如此悦耳</span></p><p begin="1:23.234" end="1:29.484" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.234" end="